            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Provided is a heat exchanger, including a core. The core includes a first plate (10) and a second plate (30) disposed in stack. A first inter-plate channel is formed between the first plate (10) and the second plate (30) adjacent to the first plate (10). The core further includes fins (20), the fins (20) are disposed between the first plate (10) and the second plate (30). The fins (20) are located in the first inter-plate channel.</p>
